On x86-64, stop EXCEPTION_TARGET_UNWIND at the __except scope matching
TargetIp == ImageBase + JumpTarget. Preserve enclosing __finally scopes
to prevent premature exception-object cleanup during C++ rethrows.

Index: dlls/ntdll/unwind.c
